# Third-Party Licenses

This file lists the licenses of third-party Rust crates used by the publishable
libraries in this repository.

It is generated by [`cargo about`](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about)
from `about.toml` and `about.hbs`. Do not edit by hand. Run
`scripts/regen-licenses.sh` to refresh after changing dependencies; CI rejects
pull requests where this file is out of date.

The `agent-hook-kit` crates themselves are dual-licensed under MIT and
Apache-2.0; see `LICENSE-MIT` and `LICENSE-APACHE`.

